@{
	ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>About Us | Unlim Tailor</title>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="luxury-banner position-relative">
		<picture>
			<source media="(min-width: 992px)"
					srcset="/image/whss1checimg.png">
			<source media="(min-width: 576px)"
					srcset="/image/whss1checimg.png">
			<img src="/image/whss1checimg.png"
				 class="img-fluid w-100"
				 alt="Bespoke Tailoring">
		</picture>
		<div class="position-absolute top-50 start-50 translate-middle text-center text-white px-3" style="width:100%;">
		</div>
	</div>
	<section class="our-story py-5">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row align-items-center">
				<div class="col-lg-6">
					<div class="story-image overflow-hidden">
						<img src="/image/imgtext_1_img.jpg" alt="Suit Detail" class="img-fluid w-75 mx-auto d-block">
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-6">
					<span class="text-uppercase d-block mx-auto letter-spacing">
						Our Story
					</span>

					<h3 class="mt-2 mb-4 text-dark">
						UNLIM Tailor – Tailoring Class
					</h3>

					<p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
						Since establishing the UNLIM Tailor brand, we have been committed to more than simply tailoring a suit; we aspire to create a refined presence for individuals who carry great responsibility.
					</p>

					<p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
						Our clients include politicians and business leaders — individuals who represent not only themselves but entire organizations and nations. Every appearance must embody composure, dignity, and distinction.
					</p>

					<p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
						Each suit is meticulously handcrafted and fully personalized. We operate in a private, discreet environment — because elegance and confidentiality are essential to the elite.
					</p>

					<p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
						Fabrics are sourced from prestigious suppliers in Italy and England, ensuring that excellence begins from the very first touch.
					</p>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="journey-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2 class="journey-title">OUR JOURNEY</h2>
			<div class="timeline">
				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="icon-logo"><img src="~/image/6666.png" /></div>
					<div class="dot"></div>
					<p>2015: BORN FROM<br>PASSION</p>
				</div>

				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="icon-logo"><img src="~/image/6666.png" /></div>
					<div class="dot"></div>
					<p>2018: EXPANDING THE<br>COLLECTION</p>
				</div>

				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="icon-logo"><img src="~/image/2.png" /></div>
					<div class="dot"></div>
					<p>PERFECT FIT</p>
				</div>

				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="icon-logo"><img src="~/image/3.png" /></div>
					<div class="dot"></div>
					<p>EXQUISITE<br>FABRICS</p>
				</div>

				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="icon-logo"><img src="~/image/2.png" /></div>
					<div class="dot"></div>
					<p>2022: TIMELESS<br>DESIGN</p>
				</div>

				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="icon-logo"><img src="~/image/1.png" /></div>
					<div class="dot"></div>
					<p>THE WEDDING<br>EDIT</p>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="pillars">
		<div class="section-title">OUR PILLARS</div>
		<div class="pillars-grid">
			<div class="pillar-item">
				<div class="icon-container">
					<img src="~/image/banmay.png" />
				</div>
				<h4>1. PRECISION CRAFT</h4>
				<p>Tailoring built on dedication.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="pillar-item">
				<div class="icon-container">
					<img src="~/image/vector-kim.png" alt="Alternate Text" />
				</div>
				<h4>2. MODERN FIT</h4>
				<p>Designed for the way you move.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="pillar-item">
				<div class="icon-container">
					<img src="~/image/vector-day.png" />
				</div>
				<h4>3. UNLIMITED CUSTOMIZATION</h4>
				<p>Your vision, limitless choices.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="craftsmanship-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-header text-center mt-5">
				<h2>THE CRAFTSMANSHIP</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="craft-row">
				<div class="craft-image">
					<img src="/image/abus-vest.png" alt="abus-vest.png">
				</div>
				<div class="craft-content">
					<h4>TENTATIVE YET PRECISE:</h4>
					<h3>Pattern Making</h3>
					<p>
						A morning dress is a men's outfit typically worn for formal morning events such as weddings, graduations, or tea parties. Unlike white
						tie and black tie, which are for evening wear (evening dress), a morning dress is a formal daytime outfit (day dress).
						Despite its strict dress code, the morning dress possesses unique features in style, materials, and the way garments are combined,
						giving the wearer a distinctive look.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="craft-row reverse">
				<div class="craft-image">
					<img src="/image/abus-hand.png" alt="abus-hand.png">
				</div>
				<div class="craft-content">
					<h4>TILLING THE DETAILS:</h4>
					<h3>Exquisite Finishing</h3>
					<p>
						Business formal encompasses all formal events that don't explicitly require white-tie, black-tie, or morning dress code attire.
						These events are generally more relaxed in terms of both organization and attendees compared to the aforementioned types of events,
						such as year-end company parties, branch openings, partner appreciation events, or simply sitting down for negotiations with an important
						business partner. Additionally, business formal is also a widely used dress code for everyday office work in certain sectors like law,
						finance, government, or as required by the company.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="cta py-5">
		<h2 class="text-dark text-uppercase">Set An appointment</h2>
		<div class="cta-buttons">
			<button class="btn-book">BOOK NOW</button>
		</div>
	</section>
	@section Styles {
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/contact.css" />
	}
</body>
</html>